# Paths that exist ONLY on the `dev` branch: guides, demos, tests and tooling.
# `npm run sync:main` (scripts/sync-main.sh) publishes dev → main and deletes these paths from main.
#
# One path or bash glob per line, relative to the repo root. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Never list product files here: extension/, README.md, LICENSE, CHANGELOG.md, docs/PRIVACY.md (the Chrome
# Web Store privacy-policy URL points at main), the images README.md shows, .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE, .gitignore.

# Notes for Claude / contributors
CLAUDE.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
.mainignore

# Guides
docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
docs/ALGORITHM.md
docs/PUBLISHING.md

# Demo / dev harness
dev

# Tests
tests

# Tooling (build, check, package, sync, CI)
scripts
i18n
package.json
.github/workflows
.github/dependabot.yml
.github/pull_request_template.md

# Store-upload working files
store-assets/src
